Wait for events on an epoll instance "epfd". Returns the number of * triggered events returned in "events" buffer. Or -1 in case of * error with the "errno" variable set to the specific error code. The * "events" parameter is a buffer that will contain triggered * events. The "maxevents" is the maximum number of events to be * returned ( usually size of "events" ). The "timeout" parameter * specifies the maximum wait time in milliseconds (-1 == infinite).lib/std/os/linux/epoll.c3:130:15fnstd::os::linux::htonlfn uint htonl(uint hostlong)
