Add a duration. The following behaviour applies: FAR_FUTURE + duration = FAR_FUTURE FAR_PAST + duration = FAR_PAST time + FOREVER = FAR_FUTURE time + FOREVER_PAST = FAR_PAST FAR_FUTURE + FOREVER_PAST = FAR_FUTURE FAR_PAST + FOREVER = FAR_PAST Addition and subtraction will saturate to FAR_FUTURE and FAR_PAST.lib/std/time/time.c3:188:14methodstd::time::Time.add_hoursfn Time add_hours(Time time, long hours)lib/std/time/time.c3:171:14methodstd::time::Time.add_minutesfn Time add_minutes(Time time, long minutes)lib/std/time/time.c3:170:14methodstd::time::Time.add_secondsfn Time add_seconds(Time time, long seconds)lib/std/time/time.c3:169:14methodstd::time::Time.add_weeksfn Time add_weeks(Time time, long weeks)lib/std/time/time.c3:173:14methodstd::time::Time.compare_tofn int compare_to(Time time, Time other)lib/std/time/time.c3:205:13methodstd::time::Time.diff_daysfn double diff_days(Time time, Time other)lib/std/time/time.c3:234:16methodstd::time::Time.diff_hoursfn double diff_hours(Time time, Time other)lib/std/time/time.c3:233:16methodstd::time::Time.diff_minfn double diff_min(Time time, Time other)lib/std/time/time.c3:232:16methodstd::time::Time.diff_monthsfn double diff_months(Time time, Time other)lib/std/time/time.c3:236:16methodstd::time::Time.diff_secfn double diff_sec(Time time, Time other)lib/std/time/time.c3:231:16methodstd::time::Time.diff_usfn Duration diff_us(Time time, Time other)
Return the difference between two times. FAR_FUTURE - time = FOREVER FAR_FUTURE - FAR_FUTURE = FOREVER FAR_PAST - time = FOREVER_PAST FAR_PAST - FAR_PAST = FOREVER_PAST Value will saturate, so any value exceeding FOREVER and FOREVER_PAST sentinels will saturate to those values.lib/std/time/time.c3:230:18methodstd::time::Time.diff_weeksfn double diff_weeks(Time time, Time other)lib/std/time/time.c3:235:16methodstd::time::Time.diff_yearsfn double diff_years(Time time, Time other)lib/std/time/time.c3:237:16methodstd::time::Time.sub_durationfn Time sub_duration(Time time, Duration duration)
